<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Azure">
  <data key="d0">Azure</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure is Microsoft's cloud computing platform, providing a wide range of services for hosting, scaling, and managing applications. It offers both Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) and Platform as a Service (PaaS) solutions, including Virtual Machines and scale sets, across various regions. The platform provides networking, compute, data services, and architecture guidance, with diverse feature sets across languages, SDKs, and APIs, supporting various encryption models.

Azure is designed for deploying and monitoring mission-critical workloads, offering highly available and reliable compute and data platform services. It provides subscriptions and infrastructure services for application deployment within a hyperscale cloud environment.

Separately, "Azure" also refers to a network policy plugin for Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) that uses Linux IPTables to enforce specified network policies. This is a distinct component within the broader Azure ecosystem rather than the cloud platform itself.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure is Microsoft's cloud computing platform that provides various services for deploying and managing applications and infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Azure is a cloud platform that enables deployment and management of cloud solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure is Microsoft's cloud platform used for hosting mission-critical workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft's cloud platform that the Well-Architected Framework guidance is centered on.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure is a cloud platform whose core and native functionalities are leveraged in the maturity model's foundational level.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure is Microsoft's cloud computing platform providing various services and features.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e07a49a74635d695d2a74e26e941143f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77437de30be507969c1117574fed4849&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3d8041b90240539202a251be26880b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b2f79e880d3ae7cbc10150a4958b75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7092b7ad42e474e7a19995579b487a34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceea393f341ad536e3a85d5af262a1bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13da8c10e8b6b19647675081cbb79073&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8200e1f0295324acfed0587523ace64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-390c92e4b952c987f9e0e7d0deeafa36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d5fef3c980e677376967817f32d9dad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0de195b0afed20e3d851a968d363d0ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defd991d185ed0d546fc2887007b9160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bdc71fab10e8d772205c8ac9acd6546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e8384b0bc1068b56283b3c6b4bb02b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31cf91ba30eab331729c73c4002b505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-387611e470f83bbe5d875c098db01fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d7ba45bf48a024a996731f69cab5301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50bf24a002558d213cd02700a64f5c07</data>
