<node id="Azure SDKs">
  <data key="d0">Azure SDKs</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure SDKs are software development kits for various programming languages that provide capabilities for building Azure applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Vendor-provided SDKs for connecting to Azure dependent services with built-in resiliency capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ffc0561a80ee1b478b5e827cc0c1a93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36d66c785cc9b10b4cf377888b6bd59f</data>
