<node id="Microservices Architecture">
  <data key="d0">Microservices Architecture</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An architecture style consistent with mission-critical requirements that facilitates high availability by preventing cascading failures.&lt;SEP&gt;Microservices architecture is a style where programming languages and frameworks are optimized at the microservice level.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ffc0561a80ee1b478b5e827cc0c1a93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ed4331e930dc66a90d716e75ccb847e</data>
