<node id="Mission-Critical Application">
  <data key="d0">Mission-Critical Application</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An application designed to withstand regional and zone failures, maximizing service availability and reliability through resiliency patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;A mission-critical application requires secure, reliable, and scalable ingress traffic with maximum reliability aspirations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ed4331e930dc66a90d716e75ccb847e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6ee1b46c13062b2f84bc4bd8740f6c3</data>
