<node id="Azure Cosmos DB">
  <data key="d0">Azure Cosmos DB</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Cosmos DB is a globally distributed, highly available NoSQL database service offered by Microsoft Azure. It serves as a primary data platform within many Azure services, designed to store "hot" data actively used by applications and support both transactional and analytical workloads. It is frequently referenced in mission-critical data platform guidance and used as an example of a downstream dependency within regional deployment stamps.

Azure Cosmos DB provides multi-region replication with multi-region write capabilities, making it particularly recommended for applications considering more than four deployment regions. It offers tunable consistency levels, conflict resolution mechanisms, and SLAs for availability and throughput, with configurable failover options supporting high availability. Configurable capabilities include multi-write deployment and periodic backups.

The service supports multiple APIs, including SQL, Cassandra, and MongoDB, and may influence programming language selection due to SDK availability. Core features include partitioning, indexing, autoscale throughput, change feed, built-in Time to Live (TTL) for managing data growth, automatic backups with multiple backup modes, and role-based access control (RBAC) for authentication. Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL specifically provides architecture best practices for globally distributed scenarios.

Azure Cosmos DB also offers an Analytical Store that enables large-scale analytics without impacting transactional performance, integrating with Azure Synapse through Synapse Link. Server-side latency is a key operational metric monitored for the service. This combination of features makes it a comprehensive platform for resource management, data replication, and diverse workload support across global deployments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36d66c785cc9b10b4cf377888b6bd59f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db1b2af74d4d806b70803e4d1daf8a47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd60f6e9fffcac30f5165dbde144c70b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caad63f908cd3b639ca5d51c5a2341ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0709e0d30d586072a6b10881d6bc306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73f080a578e1d5bcb7bab91a722b1c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058624a53f7dcacddad189523984d8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158c7610cc47ffd0b2e8ce56b6c723f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd806d5f85dca98a80362955d10e7ef7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-111b4be7044ec226f9516d7ed5776826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab7e9f04e877c8420f5dae1ad6375e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc30613029b54ffcf46bef5325576b62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b4894fcd598b00b3316bd49945a116d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-522317310460c13e3a32323fc08f14d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32d784320f22fc18cf5d44108f55403f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13da8c10e8b6b19647675081cbb79073&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09511819f8c1ba5a16e71983efd9f8b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26205fb34c4e32a46218f4e0a88ca82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a9b32aa690001ea5387c320074295c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-233362b748b88ddd9ff57f063cacd0c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20168b92f579ebd286ed6e8413a80537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180631bfef52e56155ab10e925a1d9c4</data>
