</node>
<node id="Container Registry">
  <data key="d0">Container Registry</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Container Registry is a service for hosting container images, supporting geo-replication, zone redundancy, image locking, and private endpoints.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md</data>
