<node id="Azure Geo-Redundant Storage">
  <data key="d0">Azure Geo-Redundant Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure GRS automatically replicates data to a secondary paired region, ensuring data durability if the primary region is not recoverable.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5</data>
