<node id="Log Analytics">
  <data key="d0">Log Analytics</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Log Analytics is an Azure service used for collecting, ingesting, and querying operational log data from Azure resources. It serves as a destination for both application-level and platform-level diagnostic logs. A Log Analytics workspace receives Azure Monitor operational data for Azure Cosmos DB and other global resources.

Log Analytics has operational limits, including concurrent query limits and daily ingestion caps, which may require optimization. Its exported data can be queried via Synapse Spark and used as a source for analytical workloads, including ingestion into Azure Synapse for AIOps analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics workspace serves as a global unified data sink for operational data exposed by Azure Front Door.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics is an Azure monitoring service with expanded guidance for workspaces and ingestion-time transformation to reduce costs.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics is an Azure monitoring service with architecture best practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db1b2af74d4d806b70803e4d1daf8a47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158c7610cc47ffd0b2e8ce56b6c723f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-522317310460c13e3a32323fc08f14d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09511819f8c1ba5a16e71983efd9f8b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4678f659d2199619f053d40287ff2e4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26205fb34c4e32a46218f4e0a88ca82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7620929405aff597a8fb7046b3e2aa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a9b32aa690001ea5387c320074295c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-233362b748b88ddd9ff57f063cacd0c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab2911837499c055b346ca8d6a1cac17</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/whats-new.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777292769</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Event Hubs">
  <data key="d0">Azure Event Hubs</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Event Hubs is used to route diagnostic logs to third-party tools.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Event Hubs is an export destination for Log Analytics workspace data, required to be in the same region as the workspace.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Event Hubs is a streaming platform that can receive exported Log Analytics data on a continuous or scheduled basis.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Event Hubs is a messaging service with best practices for operational excellence, performance efficiency, and cost control.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Event Hubs is an Azure messaging service with support for geo-replication and custom dead-letter queues.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure's event streaming platform.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Event Hubs is a big data streaming platform with architecture best practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7620929405aff597a8fb7046b3e2aa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7255c274585b0f1f482e338bbc6c26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-233362b748b88ddd9ff57f063cacd0c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab2911837499c055b346ca8d6a1cac17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20168b92f579ebd286ed6e8413a80537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180631bfef52e56155ab10e925a1d9c4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/whats-new.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777292768</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Container Registry Tasks">
  <data key="d0">Container Registry Tasks</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Container Registry tasks enable automated container building and patching in Azure Container Registry.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md</data>
