</node>
<node id="Autoscale">
  <data key="d0">Autoscale</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Autoscale ensures adequate resources are available by scaling out when any rule in a profile is met and scaling in when all rules are met.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoscale automatically adjusts throughput between 10% and 100% of a configured maximum based on application load, protecting against throttling errors.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoscale can be configured through runbook automation to ensure elasticity in response to changing traffic patterns for Azure Database for MySQL/PostgreSQL.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoscale is a feature that automatically provisions throughput in Azure Cosmos DB.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab7e9f04e877c8420f5dae1ad6375e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b4894fcd598b00b3316bd49945a116d</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291350</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Per-App Scaling">
  <data key="d0">Per-App Scaling</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Per-app scaling allows an application to scale independently from the App Service plan that hosts it.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md</data>
