</node>
<node id="Kubernetes">
  <data key="d0">Kubernetes</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Kubernetes is a container orchestration platform with RBAC, metrics API, and version release cycles.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubernetes is a container orchestration platform where secrets can be injected as environment variables into deployments or Kubernetes secrets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7e299b337a793955172863127084bd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98dfe7557b9ff125211f2a2e03cb3dce</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777292098</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Policy Add-On For AKS">
  <data key="d0">Azure Policy Add-On For AKS</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Azure Policy Add-on for AKS provides built-in policies to control pod functions like root privileges and enforce policy conformance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7e299b337a793955172863127084bd5</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777290969</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Calico">
  <data key="d0">Calico</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Calico is a network policy option usable with Azure CNI for controlling traffic within AKS clusters.&lt;SEP&gt;Calico is a network policy implementation with a richer feature set and broader community adoption and support.&lt;SEP&gt;A network policy plugin for AKS with a richer feature set including Windows node support and both Azure CNI and Kubenet compatibility.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7e299b337a793955172863127084bd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defd991d185ed0d546fc2887007b9160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d7d8989458b7b6a8098b2c4cc007937</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prometheus">
  <data key="d0">Prometheus</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Prometheus provides metrics integration within Azure Monitor for AKS container insights.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7e299b337a793955172863127084bd5</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777290969</data>
