  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An Azure Cosmos DB API that supports continuous backup configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL offers the most comprehensive feature set, particularly for performance tuning.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL is an Azure service with updated architecture best practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL is an Azure service with updated best practices including recommendations for Microsoft Entra ID, private endpoints, Azure Policy, and Azure Advisor.</data>
