<node id="Point-In-Time Restore">
  <data key="d0">Point-In-Time Restore</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">PITR allows restoring Azure Cosmos DB data to a specific point in time with one-second granularity within continuous backup mode.&lt;SEP&gt;Point-in-time restore is an operational recovery method for severe configuration errors in Azure SQL Database.&lt;SEP&gt;Point-in-time restore is an operational playbook method to recover from severe configuration errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caad63f908cd3b639ca5d51c5a2341ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058624a53f7dcacddad189523984d8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623</data>
