  <data key="d0">Request Units</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Request Units per second (RU/s) are the measure of throughput provisioned in Azure Cosmos DB, billed per region.&lt;SEP&gt;Request Units (RUs) are the billing unit for Azure Cosmos DB, charged per region for replicated configurations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0709e0d30d586072a6b10881d6bc306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab7e9f04e877c8420f5dae1ad6375e0f</data>
