<node id="Resource Locks">
  <data key="d0">Resource Locks</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Resource Locks protect Azure Cosmos DB resources against incorrect modification or deletion, applying only to control plane operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource Locks prevent accidental deletion or modification of Azure Cosmos DB resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource locks are a mechanism to prevent Azure resources from being modified or deleted, recommended mainly for long-lived global resources rather than ephemeral regional resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0709e0d30d586072a6b10881d6bc306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b4894fcd598b00b3316bd49945a116d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787</data>
