  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A built-in RBAC role enabling read-only access to Azure Cosmos DB resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Cosmos DB Account Reader is a built-in RBAC role for reading Azure Cosmos DB account data.</data>
