<node id="Cosmos DB Operator">
  <data key="d0">Cosmos DB Operator</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A built-in RBAC role similar to DocumentDB Account Contributor but without ability to manage keys or role assignments.&lt;SEP&gt;Cosmos DB Operator is a built-in RBAC role for operating Azure Cosmos DB resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0709e0d30d586072a6b10881d6bc306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b4894fcd598b00b3316bd49945a116d</data>
