  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Synapse Analytics is a Microsoft analytics service with SQL Serverless pools and Spark pools that can query Azure Cosmos DB Analytical Store.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Synapse Analytics is an analytics service providing unified experience through Azure Synapse Studio.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73f080a578e1d5bcb7bab91a722b1c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-522317310460c13e3a32323fc08f14d4</data>
