  <data key="d0">Azure SQL Analytics</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure SQL Analytics provides near real-time operational insights for detection of reliability incidents in Azure SQL DB.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure SQL Analytics is a monitoring tool for analyzing data and creating alerts for Azure SQL databases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73f080a578e1d5bcb7bab91a722b1c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623</data>
