  <data key="d0">Azure Cache For Redis</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Cache for Redis is an in-memory caching service based on open source Redis, offering Premium, Enterprise, and Enterprise Flash tiers with geo-replication and high availability capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cache for Redis is a caching service with features for connection resilience and scheduled updates.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cache for Redis had its service guide retired as the content was outdated.</data>
