<node id="Azure Cosmos DB Analytical Store">
  <data key="d0">Azure Cosmos DB Analytical Store</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Cosmos DB Analytical Store applies a column format for optimized analytical queries with multi-region availability.&lt;SEP&gt;A fully isolated column-oriented data store that enables large-scale analytics on Azure Cosmos DB data without impacting transactional workloads, with auto-sync latency usually under two minutes.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cosmos DB Analytical Store is an optimized column store for performing analytics on operational data without impacting transactional performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cosmos DB Analytical Store is a column store enabling analytical queries on operational data in Azure Cosmos DB.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73f080a578e1d5bcb7bab91a722b1c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158c7610cc47ffd0b2e8ce56b6c723f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-111b4be7044ec226f9516d7ed5776826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc30613029b54ffcf46bef5325576b62</data>
