<node id="Hyperscale (Citus)">
  <data key="d0">Hyperscale (Citus)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Hyperscale (Citus) is a PostgreSQL deployment option providing dynamic scalability through sharding, with 99.95% SLA when High Availability is enabled.&lt;SEP&gt;Hyperscale (Citus) is a deployment option for Azure Database for PostgreSQL that provides dynamic scalability through sharding, with 99.95% SLA when High Availability is enabled.&lt;SEP&gt;Hyperscale (Citus) is a deployment option for Azure Database For PostgreSQL that maximizes availability across multiple nodes with High Availability mode offering 99.95% SLA.&lt;SEP&gt;Hyperscale (Citus) is a PostgreSQL-based distributed database option on Azure supporting sharding and reserved pricing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73f080a578e1d5bcb7bab91a722b1c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058624a53f7dcacddad189523984d8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc30613029b54ffcf46bef5325576b62</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291348</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Active Geo-Replication">
  <data key="d0">Active Geo-Replication</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Active Geo-Replication deploys readable replicas within all deployment regions, up to four.&lt;SEP&gt;Active Geo-Replication is a feature of Azure SQL Database that enables readable secondary databases in different regions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73f080a578e1d5bcb7bab91a722b1c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623</data>
