<node id="Azure SQL Database">
  <data key="d0">Azure SQL Database</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure SQL Database is a fully managed relational database service offered by Microsoft on the Azure cloud platform. It is a mature relational database engine recommended for relational data requirements, providing a wide range of reliability, security, and performance capabilities.

Azure SQL Database supports high availability features including availability zones, zone redundancy, geo-replication, auto failover groups, and automated backups, offering up to a 99.995% SLA. It also supports sharding for horizontal scaling.

The service includes comprehensive guidance and best practices covering architecture design, connection pooling, performance optimization, cost optimization, secure data storage, and immutable storage for audit logs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73f080a578e1d5bcb7bab91a722b1c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc30613029b54ffcf46bef5325576b62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-233362b748b88ddd9ff57f063cacd0c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab2911837499c055b346ca8d6a1cac17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062b3d27f8d0d9d1409bb3878692b58b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20168b92f579ebd286ed6e8413a80537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180631bfef52e56155ab10e925a1d9c4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/whats-new.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777292751</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Synapse Spark">
  <data key="d0">Azure Synapse Spark</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Synapse Spark is a Spark-based analytics engine within Azure Synapse Analytics used to query and process data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73f080a578e1d5bcb7bab91a722b1c8c</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291348</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Cosmos DB Change Feed">
  <data key="d0">Azure Cosmos DB Change Feed</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A feature of Azure Cosmos DB that can be used to maintain a separate secondary data store for analytical scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cosmos DB change feed can maintain a separate secondary data store for analytical scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cosmos DB change feed is a feature that provides a log of changes to items in a container.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cosmos DB change feed provides a mechanism for tracking changes in Azure Cosmos DB.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73f080a578e1d5bcb7bab91a722b1c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158c7610cc47ffd0b2e8ce56b6c723f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-111b4be7044ec226f9516d7ed5776826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-522317310460c13e3a32323fc08f14d4</data>
