</node>
<node id="Azure Database For PostgreSQL">
  <data key="d0">Azure Database For PostgreSQL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Database For PostgreSQL is a managed relational database offered in Single Server, Flexible Server, and Hyperscale (Citus) deployment options.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Database for PostgreSQL is a managed database service on Azure offering Single Server, Flexible Server, and Hyperscale (Citus) deployment options.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Database For PostgreSQL is a managed database service offering Flexible Server and Hyperscale (Citus) options for business critical workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Database for PostgreSQL is a managed PostgreSQL database service on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure's managed PostgreSQL database service.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Database for PostgreSQL is a managed PostgreSQL database service with architecture best practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-058624a53f7dcacddad189523984d8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc30613029b54ffcf46bef5325576b62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-233362b748b88ddd9ff57f063cacd0c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50bf24a002558d213cd02700a64f5c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180631bfef52e56155ab10e925a1d9c4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/whats-new.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777292770</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Synapse">
  <data key="d0">Azure Synapse</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Synapse is an enterprise analytical platform combining relational and non-relational data with Spark technologies and built-in Azure service integration for big data analytics.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Synapse is an enterprise analytical platform that combines relational and non-relational data with Spark technologies, including SQL data warehousing, Spark big data, and Data Explorer capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Synapse brings together SQL data warehousing, Spark big data, and Data Explorer for log and time series analytics.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Synapse Analytics is an analytical platform offering ML capabilities, Spark Pools, notebooks, and native integration with Azure Data Factory for AIOps and predictive action.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Synapse is an analytics service used for ingesting and analyzing Log Analytics operational data.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Synapse is an Azure analytics service.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-058624a53f7dcacddad189523984d8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158c7610cc47ffd0b2e8ce56b6c723f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-111b4be7044ec226f9516d7ed5776826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73d35a819f81fdf6e061b2c836acac71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4678f659d2199619f053d40287ff2e4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7620929405aff597a8fb7046b3e2aa5</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Flexible Server">
  <data key="d0">Flexible Server</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Flexible Server is a deployment option offering Availability Zone redundancy with 99.99% SLA, cost efficiencies through stop/start capability, and burstable compute tier.&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible Server is a deployment option for Azure Database For PostgreSQL recommended for business critical workloads due to Availability Zone support.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-058624a53f7dcacddad189523984d8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623</data>
