<node id="Azure Chaos Studio">
  <data key="d0">Azure Chaos Studio</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Chaos Studio is a native suite of chaos experimentation tools for conducting chaos experiments and injecting faults within Azure services and application components.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Chaos Studio is an Azure service for chaos engineering and fault injection testing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11bac6534273a4d1656750c49ac2fcee</data>
