  <data key="d5">1777291480</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Infrastructure As Code">
  <data key="d0">Infrastructure As Code</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Infrastructure as code (IaC) is the practice of managing infrastructure through code artifacts like Terraform or ARM templates, used across all environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrastructure as code (IaC) treats infrastructure definitions as source code that is version controlled, promoting consistency, eliminating human error, and providing traceability and rollback.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrastructure as code is a fundamental reliability concept involving engineering investment for deployment automation.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrastructure as code automates provisioning of Azure resources using tools like ARM templates, Bicep, or Terraform.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75881c2e5d7a1909b7080e2819bc0413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98dfe7557b9ff125211f2a2e03cb3dce</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777292098</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dependabot">
  <data key="d0">Dependabot</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Dependabot is a tool for GitHub repositories that automatically keeps dependencies up to date with the latest releases.&lt;SEP&gt;Dependabot is a GitHub tool for automated dependency version updates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11bac6534273a4d1656750c49ac2fcee</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291480</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
