  <data key="d0">GitHub Actions</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">GitHub Actions is an Azure-native toolset for deploying and managing mission-critical applications.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub Actions is an Azure-native toolset provided by Microsoft, well-suited for build tasks (continuous integration).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4</data>
