  <data key="d0">Azure Pipelines</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Pipelines is an Azure-native toolset for deploying and managing mission-critical applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Pipelines is an Azure-native toolset provided by Microsoft, recommended for mission-critical deployments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291481</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure DevOps">
  <data key="d0">Azure DevOps</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure DevOps is a platform whose capabilities overlap with GitHub and can be used together for deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure DevOps is a deployment tooling platform with a rich feature set, recommended for mission-critical deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure DevOps is a CI/CD platform that uses service connections and build agents to deploy and manage Azure resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9406ed2aa903d9c51a1e6e1d68aee2dc</data>
