  <data key="d5">1777292359</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mission Critical Online">
  <data key="d0">Mission Critical Online</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A reference implementation on GitHub providing examples including a user load generator for mission-critical applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission Critical Online is a reference implementation used as an example for failure mode analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c437470f34ed638659632da76be560f</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291481</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Load Testing">
  <data key="d0">Load Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Testing that places synthetic user load on an application, typically performed in parallel with chaos testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Load testing validates scalability and application operation by increasing load rapidly or gradually until a predetermined threshold is reached.&lt;SEP&gt;Load testing determines whether a system risks exceeding scalability limits during expected production load and helps set autoscaling thresholds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c437470f34ed638659632da76be560f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8200e1f0295324acfed0587523ace64</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291481</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Failure Mode Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Failure Mode Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Failure mode analysis introduces faults into application and infrastructure to assess redundancy mechanisms, identifying risk, impact, and breadth of impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Failure mode analysis is an architecture strategy that distinguishes failures from errors and considers read and write failures separately.&lt;SEP&gt;Failure mode analysis is an architecture strategy for reliability that helps distinguish failures from errors.&lt;SEP&gt;Failure mode analysis (FMA) helps workloads recover gracefully within defined recovery objectives, emphasizing alignment with specific targets.&lt;SEP&gt;An architecture strategy for analyzing potential failure modes in reliability design.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-973e5b950ce99287babd4d9e8e310ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20168b92f579ebd286ed6e8413a80537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4e1326f308873031b3e530e46d8478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180631bfef52e56155ab10e925a1d9c4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/whats-new.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777292722</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stress Testing">
  <data key="d0">Stress Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Stress testing applies activities that overload existing resources to determine solution limits and verify the system's ability to recover gracefully.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress testing helps identify limitations of system components such as network components or databases that cannot appropriately scale.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8200e1f0295324acfed0587523ace64</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291481</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Smoke Tests">
  <data key="d0">Smoke Tests</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Smoke tests are run as part of every deployment to validate basic application functionality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291482</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blue/Green Deployments">
  <data key="d0">Blue/Green Deployments</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Blue/green deployments require the use of Infrastructure as Code with fully automated deployments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291482</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blue/Green Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Blue/Green Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A deployment model requiring at least two identical deployments where traffic is gradually transitioned from the active (blue) to the new (green) deployment, enabling zero-downtime upgrades.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4c437470f34ed638659632da76be560f</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291482</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Mission-Critical">
  <data key="d0">Azure Mission-Critical</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Mission-Critical recommends deploying infrastructure and applications together as deployment stamps using blue/green deployment approaches.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4c437470f34ed638659632da76be560f</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291482</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Front Door">
  <data key="d0">Azure Front Door</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Front Door is a globally distributed Azure service that functions as a global load balancer, traffic routing platform, and content delivery solution for HTTP/HTTPS scenarios. It leverages Anycast protocol with split TCP for optimized connectivity and provides edge caching for both static and dynamic content.

Key capabilities include Web Application Firewall (WAF) integration, built-in DDoS protection, TLS certificate management (including managed certificates), health probes, load distribution, session affinity, and header-based filtering. It is designed to support mission-critical applications with robust security and performance features.

Azure Front Door serves as an ingress traffic routing service, with service tags used in Network Security Groups (NSGs) to validate legitimate traffic origins. It can orchestrate automated traffic transitions between blue and green deployment environments.

As a global Azure resource, Azure Front Door's request count is a key metric for operational dashboards and monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Front Door provides built-in capabilities for SSL certificate management and renewal.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Front Door is used with web application firewall policies to deliver and protect global HTTP/S applications spanning multiple Azure regions.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Front Door is an Azure service with AI-powered security capabilities, Security Copilot integration, and managed wildcard TLS certificates.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Front Door is an Azure service with updated recommendations on deployment strategies, caching, traffic management, and health probes.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Front Door is a global load balancing and CDN service with architecture best practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4c437470f34ed638659632da76be560f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09511819f8c1ba5a16e71983efd9f8b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26205fb34c4e32a46218f4e0a88ca82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defd991d185ed0d546fc2887007b9160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce015784fd1d8129dac8c9bbf32bf565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc31ff972bb32047bd652b7c4ab8132&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d7d8989458b7b6a8098b2c4cc007937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ff5c56a565c7a13e4cc5066c5ed0775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6ee1b46c13062b2f84bc4bd8740f6c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a9b32aa690001ea5387c320074295c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9406ed2aa903d9c51a1e6e1d68aee2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-233362b748b88ddd9ff57f063cacd0c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab2911837499c055b346ca8d6a1cac17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062b3d27f8d0d9d1409bb3878692b58b</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/whats-new.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777292742</data>
