  <data key="d0">Branching Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A branching strategy ensures maximum reliability, enables parallel development, and supports fast releases from development to production.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4</data>
