<node id="Data Virtualization">
  <data key="d0">Data Virtualization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Data virtualization is a modern analytics approach that doesn't require ETL and data movement, enabling ongoing analysis by AIOps models.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
