<node id="CI/CD Pipelines">
  <data key="d0">CI/CD Pipelines</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous integration and continuous deployment pipelines designed to support frequent, consistent deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;CI/CD pipelines are continuous integration and continuous deployment processes that emit telemetry data and can be supplemented with AIOps methodologies.&lt;SEP&gt;CI/CD pipelines are used alongside the health model to validate application health after code and configuration updates, including load and chaos testing.&lt;SEP&gt;CI/CD pipelines are automated processes for continuous integration and deployment of application components.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0de195b0afed20e3d851a968d363d0ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6c19c90a7ec75e7d95d807c1817fcf</data>
