  <data key="d0">Mission-Critical Online</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A reference implementation on GitHub illustrating zero-downtime deployment approaches for Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-Critical Online is a GitHub reference implementation for mission-critical workloads on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-Critical Online is a reference implementation available on GitHub providing a comprehensive health model example.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-Critical Online is a reference implementation hosted on GitHub for Azure mission-critical workloads.</data>
