  <data key="d0">Mission-Critical Connected</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Mission-Critical Connected is a GitHub reference implementation for connected mission-critical workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-Critical Connected is a reference implementation available on GitHub providing a comprehensive health model example.&lt;SEP&gt;Mission-Critical Connected is a reference implementation hosted on GitHub for connected mission-critical workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11bac6534273a4d1656750c49ac2fcee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee778ccfa3886c52f485cafeef0009b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7620929405aff597a8fb7046b3e2aa5</data>
