<node id="Zero-Downtime Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Zero-Downtime Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Zero-downtime deployment is a strategy where new infrastructure is deployed alongside existing infrastructure, tested, traffic is transitioned, and old infrastructure is decommissioned without affecting users.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md</data>
