<node id="Terraform">
  <data key="d0">Terraform</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Terraform is an IaC tool used for defining and deploying infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Terraform is an infrastructure-as-code tool whose providers need to be kept up to date as part of update management.&lt;SEP&gt;Terraform is an infrastructure-as-code tool whose resources can be used alongside Azure policies for common design patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;Terraform is an infrastructure-as-code solution for automating resource provisioning.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98dfe7557b9ff125211f2a2e03cb3dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29</data>
