<node id="CI/CD">
  <data key="d0">CI/CD</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous Integration and Continuous Deployment automation that enables short-lived development environments and promotes developer agility.&lt;SEP&gt;CI/CD (Continuous Integration/Continuous Deployment) processes are used to validate key alert rules and may require real-time scoring for AIOps scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous integration and continuous delivery is an automated approach to deploying application and infrastructure code artifacts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75881c2e5d7a1909b7080e2819bc0413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4678f659d2199619f053d40287ff2e4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29</data>
