<node id="DDoS">
  <data key="d0">DDoS</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Distributed Denial-Of-Service attacks are common attack vectors against network endpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;Denial-Of-Service attacks are known to have catastrophic impact on availability and performance of applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75881c2e5d7a1909b7080e2819bc0413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31cf91ba30eab331729c73c4002b505</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777292363</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Business Continuity">
  <data key="d0">Business Continuity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Planning and practice drills to maximize resiliency in the event of unplanned downtime.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75881c2e5d7a1909b7080e2819bc0413</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
