</node>
<node id="Active/Active Design">
  <data key="d0">Active/Active Design</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A deployment model where solution components are distributed across multiple Availability Zones and Azure regions to maximize availability and achieve regional fault tolerance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291589</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blast Radius Reduction And Fault Isolation">
  <data key="d0">Blast Radius Reduction And Fault Isolation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A method of designing solutions in a resilient manner by anticipating failures and correlated impact from individual components to entire Azure regions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291590</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Design For Self-Healing">
  <data key="d0">Design For Self-Healing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Design for self-healing is a resiliency principle focused on systems recovering automatically from failures.&lt;SEP&gt;A concept describing a system's ability to deal with failures automatically through pre-defined remediation protocols connected to failure modes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb446ff77685d5a057445825bab9dcd5</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291590</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Design For Scale-Out">
  <data key="d0">Design For Scale-Out</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Design for scale-out is a resiliency principle focused on horizontal scaling.&lt;SEP&gt;A concept focusing on a system's ability to respond to demand through horizontal growth by adding resource units in parallel.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb446ff77685d5a057445825bab9dcd5</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291590</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Observe Application Health">
  <data key="d0">Observe Application Health</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A method of monitoring application operation relative to a known healthy state to detect or predict reliability issues and enable swift remedial action.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291590</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Drive Automation">
  <data key="d0">Drive Automation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Drive automation is a resiliency principle in the Azure Well-Architected Framework.&lt;SEP&gt;A principle to minimize human error by striving for automation in all aspects of a cloud solution including automated testing, deployment, and management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb446ff77685d5a057445825bab9dcd5</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291590</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Complexity Avoidance">
  <data key="d0">Complexity Avoidance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A design principle to avoid unnecessary complexity when designing solutions and operational processes to drive reliability and management efficiencies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291590</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Loosely Coupled Components">
  <data key="d0">Loosely Coupled Components</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Loosely coupled components is a DevOps architecture principle.&lt;SEP&gt;A method enabling independent testing, deployments, and updates to application components while minimizing inter-team dependencies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb446ff77685d5a057445825bab9dcd5</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291591</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Automate Build And Release Processes">
  <data key="d0">Automate Build And Release Processes</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Automate build and release processes is a DevOps principle for optimizing deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;A method of fully automating build and release processes to reduce friction, increase deployment velocity, and bring repeatability and consistency across environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f86c34d935d91c0feba2784fca188c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb446ff77685d5a057445825bab9dcd5</data>
