<node id="Service Level Objective">
  <data key="d0">Service Level Objective</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Service Level Objective (SLO) is a target for availability attainment calculated using the health model, distinguishing between service degradation and unavailability.&lt;SEP&gt;Service Level Objective (SLO) is a target for availability attainment calculated using the health model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aee778ccfa3886c52f485cafeef0009b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0de195b0afed20e3d851a968d363d0ca</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291768</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Log Analytics Workspace">
  <data key="d0">Log Analytics Workspace</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Log Analytics workspace serves as the core Azure-native data sink for storing and analyzing operational data.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics workspace is a resource for storing logs and enabling data collection and querying capabilities, deployed into a specified Azure region.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics workspace is a unified data sink in Azure Monitor for gathering operational data, with query rate limits and data retention policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics Workspace is used for ingesting and analyzing activity logs from Microsoft Entra and other sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aee778ccfa3886c52f485cafeef0009b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc4a6aa7dad91160ab49f8c99c2ea47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7255c274585b0f1f482e338bbc6c26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c9347a4bec9630cfbf008260182d80</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777292354</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Grafana">
  <data key="d0">Grafana</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Grafana is a visualization tool used to represent aggregated health scores as dependency charts.&lt;SEP&gt;Grafana is a market-leading observability and visualization solution, also available as Azure Managed Grafana.&lt;SEP&gt;Grafana is an alternative visualization solution with market-leading capabilities and an extensive open-source plugin ecosystem, recommended when Azure Dashboards are insufficient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aee778ccfa3886c52f485cafeef0009b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09511819f8c1ba5a16e71983efd9f8b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26205fb34c4e32a46218f4e0a88ca82</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291769</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="KQL">
  <data key="d0">KQL</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">KQL (Kusto Query Language) is used to query and aggregate health metrics for cluster health status and scoring.&lt;SEP&gt;KQL (Kusto Query Language) provides operators like 'union' to aggregate queries and mitigate Log Analytics query limits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aee778ccfa3886c52f485cafeef0009b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26205fb34c4e32a46218f4e0a88ca82</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777291770</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
