<node id="Multicloud Active-Active Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Multicloud Active-Active Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A multicloud active-active deployment approach provides broader redundancy to global outage scenarios but introduces significant operational complexities that pose resiliency risks.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment approach with active stamps across two or more cloud providers for mitigating global platform failure risks, though not recommended due to operational complexity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1ff5c56a565c7a13e4cc5066c5ed0775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a9b32aa690001ea5387c320074295c</data>
