<node id="Anycast Protocol">
  <data key="d0">Anycast Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Anycast protocol is used by Azure Front Door with split TCP to optimize connectivity and take advantage of the Microsoft global backbone network.</data>
