<node id="ExpressRoute">
  <data key="d0">ExpressRoute</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">ExpressRoute is an Azure service providing secure connections with bandwidths up to 100 Gbps for on-premises or cross-cloud network integration.&lt;SEP&gt;ExpressRoute is used to access Azure PaaS services from on-premises via private peering for hybrid application scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;ExpressRoute provides hybrid connectivity to Azure PaaS services from on-premises via private peering.</data>
