  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Virtual WAN is a networking service supporting hub-and-spoke network designs and VPN connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Virtual WAN is an Azure networking service with guidance on cost modeling, hub capacity planning, and IaC automation.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Virtual WAN is a networking service with architectural best practices aligned with the Well-Architected Framework pillars.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Virtual WAN is an Azure networking service with architecture best practices documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure's networking service for WAN connectivity.</data>
