  <data key="d0">Service Endpoints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Service Endpoints can be used for services that don't support Private Link, with data exfiltration risk considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;Service Endpoints are an Azure networking feature associated with data exfiltration risks compared to private endpoints.</data>
