<node id="Azure Resource Manager">
  <data key="d0">Azure Resource Manager</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Resource Manager is a management control plane in Azure that Azure Policy is part of.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Resource Manager provides an API and control plane for managing Azure resources and operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Resource Manager (ARM) is a control plane that Azure Policy supplements by restricting actions authorized users can perform.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8deba810ca14d9b278b1f9d887802f2</data>
