<node id="RBAC">
  <data key="d0">RBAC</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) is a method for restricting resource access based on user roles, recommended over resource locks for most resources.&lt;SEP&gt;RBAC (Role-Based Access Control) is applied with granularity to production CD pipelines to mitigate malicious admin risks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6c19c90a7ec75e7d95d807c1817fcf</data>
