<node id="STRIDE">
  <data key="d0">STRIDE</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">STRIDE is a lightweight risk framework for evaluating security threats across key threat vectors including Spoofing, Tampering, Repudiation, Information Disclosure, Denial of Service, and Elevation of Privilege.&lt;SEP&gt;STRIDE is a threat modeling methodology for identifying security threats.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bc6c19c90a7ec75e7d95d807c1817fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65bdd00b5709152c19e73a1ad56171cd</data>
