  <data key="d0">Secret Scanning</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Secret scanning detects secrets before code is committed to prevent secret leaks through source code repositories.&lt;SEP&gt;Secret scanning is a security practice enabled within source code repositories to detect exposed secrets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bc6c19c90a7ec75e7d95d807c1817fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31cf91ba30eab331729c73c4002b505</data>
